{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2005-common-biology-25","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2005,"subject":"biology","number":25,"points":null,"unitId":"reproduction","unitLabel":"생식·생식내분비","topic":"배란","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["reproduction","immune","endocrine"],"stem":"그림은출산시자궁수축에관여하는여러호르몬의작용을\n나타낸것이다.\n(가) 호르몬과(나) 호르몬의일반적인특징중옳은것을<보기>\n에서모두고른것은?\n<보\n기>\nㄱ. (가) 호르몬이결핍되면갱년기질환이유발될수있다.\nㄴ. (가) 호르몬은배란주기의조절에도관여하며배란후\n최대치에이른다.\nㄷ. (나) 호르몬은거의모든세포에서만들어지며염증작용과\n관련이있다.\nㄹ. (나) 호르몬은\n분자구조가\n불안정하여\n국소조절자(local\nregulator)로작용한다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t018"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄴ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t019"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t020"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t021"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":537,"height":681,"region":0,"bbox":[56.755,46.22,214.8,272.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2005-common-biology-25/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":772,"height":355,"region":0,"bbox":[13.955,378.22,308.8,142.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2005-common-biology-25/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":7,"sourceRect":[429.645,152.18,758.256,721.458],"width":328.611,"height":569.278,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[56.755,46.22,214.8,272.4],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[13.955,378.22,308.8,142.0],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"25. 그림은출산시자궁수축에관여하는여러호르몬의작용을","bbox":[5.0,5.0,318.54,11.035],"spans":